Here's a PHP custom function "smart_sort_array" that meets your requirements:

```php
function smart_sort_array($set, $order) {
    // Sort elements of set by age in ascending order (default)
    if ($order === 'asc') {
        usort($set, function ($a, $b) {
            return $a['age'] - $b['age'];
        });
    }

    // Sort elements of set by age in descending order
    elseif ($order === 'desc') {
        usort($set, function ($a, $b) {
            return $b['age'] - $a['age'];
        });
    }

    // Invalid order parameter provided
    else {
        throw new InvalidArgumentException('Invalid order parameter provided.');
    }

    return $set;
}
```

